  status: released
battery: secondary
range_km: 10
conclusion: "Hannover's secondary battery reaches 8.3 km, short of 10 km. With Secondary Battery Modification 1 + Long-Range Secondary Battery Shells it reaches 11.95 km; at 10 km dispersion is 372 m horizontal and 341.6 m vertical."
guns:
  - mount: 128 mm
    min_radius: 1
    ideal_radius: 15.5
    ideal_distance: 333.333
    radius_on_zero: 0.1
    radius_on_delim: 0.8
    radius_on_max: 1
    delim: 0.6
builds:
  - build: base
    kind: base
    max_range_km: 8.3
    mounts:
      - mount: 128 mm
        at_range: beyond_max_range
  - build: Secondary Battery Modification 1
    kind: range_and_accuracy
    max_range_km: 9.96
    max_range_change_pct: 20
    mounts:
      - mount: 128 mm
        at_range: beyond_max_range
  - build: Long-Range Secondary Battery Shells
    kind: range
    max_range_km: 9.96
    max_range_change_pct: 20
    mounts:
      - mount: 128 mm
        at_range: beyond_max_range
  - build: Aiming Systems Modification 1
    kind: range_and_accuracy
    max_range_km: 8.72
    max_range_change_pct: 5
    mounts:
      - mount: 128 mm
        at_range: beyond_max_range
  - build: Manual Secondary Battery Aiming
    kind: accuracy
    max_range_km: 8.3
    max_range_change_pct: 0
    mounts:
      - mount: 128 mm
        at_range: beyond_max_range
  - build: Manual Secondary Battery Aiming
    kind: accuracy
    condition: "at the priority target within secondary range, after sustained fire"
    max_range_km: 8.3
    max_range_change_pct: 0
    mounts:
      - mount: 128 mm
        at_range: beyond_max_range
  - build: Secondary Battery Modification 1 + Long-Range Secondary Battery Shells
    kind: range_and_accuracy
    max_range_km: 11.95
    max_range_change_pct: 44
    mounts:
      - mount: 128 mm
        at_range:
          ellipse:
            horizontal_m: 372
            vertical_m: 341.6
            vertical_ratio: 0.918
  - build: Secondary Battery Modification 1 + Long-Range Secondary Battery Shells + Manual Secondary Battery Aiming
    kind: range_and_accuracy
    max_range_km: 11.95
    max_range_change_pct: 44
    mounts:
      - mount: 128 mm
        at_range:
          ellipse:
            horizontal_m: 334.8
            vertical_m: 307.5
            vertical_ratio: 0.918
notes:
  - "horizontal_m = 30 x (minRadius + X_m / 30 x (idealRadius - minRadius) / idealDistance), X_m the firing distance in meters and both radii times the accuracy coefficient (Aiming Systems Modification 1 and the like); it depends only on the firing distance. vertical_m = horizontal_m x vertical_ratio, where vertical_ratio runs linearly from radiusOnZero at 0 km to radiusOnDelim at delim x max range, then to radiusOnMax at max range. A longer max range lowers X / max range, so at the same X the ratio, and with it vertical dispersion, falls whenever radiusOnZero < radiusOnDelim < radiusOnMax. At max range horizontal_m is the port's maximum dispersion."
  - "Secondary max range is the base secondary range times the secondary range modifiers. The accuracy coefficient is the one the game applies in battle: GSIdealRadius times GSIdealRadiusHighLevel on tier 7 and higher ships or GSIdealRadiusLowLevel below, times GSPriorityTargetIdealRadius in rows whose condition names the priority target; the port card applies GSIdealRadius alone. Manual secondary control modes are not modeled."
